OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes' in class
OL,6,
OL,7,FLocal authorities are giving an update
OL,8,Fafter four people - a teacher and
OL,9,Fchildren aged five, eight and 11 - were
OL,10,Fkilled in a shooting at Silver Rail
OL,11,FElementary School in Bend on Thursday
OL,13,FPolice Chief Mike Krantz says a teacher
OL,14,Ffought the armed suspect before a dad
OL,15,Farmed with a.40 calibre pistol shot the
OL,16,Fsuspect "multiple times" in a classroom
OL,18,FThe suspected attacker has been
OL,19,Fidentified as 16-year-old John Griffin,
OL,20,Fthe BBC's US partner CBS News reports
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
